Okay, evaluating the **Mercedes-Benz A-Class AMG Line Night Edition**.

This designation combines the **AMG Line** trim (sporty looks, standard engine) with the **Night Package** (blacked-out exterior elements) and usually bundles additional features as part of an **'Edition'** package. It's a specific, higher-tier trim configuration.

To provide a representative evaluation, I will base this on the **most recent A200 petrol model (W177 facelift with mild-hybrid) equipped with the AMG Line Night Edition package**. This assumes the package includes the AMG Line styling, the Night Package's black accents, and potentially other bundled features like upgraded wheels, ambient lighting, or specific interior trim, making it a well-equipped version of the A200.

